					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="info-container"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">&nbsp;</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div> <p>This is the official documentation of SCP-5217</p> <p><strong>Image sources:</strong></p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> power<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedista:Li-sung">Li-sung</a><br /> <strong>License:</strong> Public Domain<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Nuclear_power_plant#/media/File:JE_Temelin1.jpg">link</a></p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Name of the file:</strong> map<br /> <strong>License:</strong> Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL)<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org">https://www.openstreetmap.org</a></p> </blockquote> <p>[[&gt;</p> </div> <hr /> <div id="u-author_block"> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ralliston-s-authorpage">▸ More by this Author ◂</a></p> <hr /></div> <div class="translation_block"> <h1><span>Translations:</span></h1> </div> <div class="u-faq"> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/component:info-ayers">F.A.Q.</a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>[[/&gt;]]</p> <p><strong>SCP 5217</strong></p> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5217</p> <strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid<br /> <img src="https://u5j4h3u7.stackpathcdn.com/pub/media/catalog/product/cache/172d96e30d7cd3d4380b53391edef300/J/B/JBFST.jpg" alt="JBFST.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5217 Needs to be kept away from any person unless said person is wearing correct Hazardous-Materials suit and follows the correct cleaning procedures after encounter with item SCP-5217 <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5217 Was found back in 2003 after a civilian came into contact with a seemingly normal gelatine product, or jelly bean, and fell into a deep coma dying only hours later police officers were called to analyse the product and found a elemental composition that is unfound in normal versions of this product. Later analysis shows that this product has a living biological composition and naturally releases a toxic gas into the air nearby and is coated in a poison similar to that of a poison dart frog</p> <p>Images product of Hancocks.co.uk</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6628226&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609447271" alt="mr intertab" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6628226)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mr-intertab" >mr intertab</a></span></p> 
