&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #&lt;/strong&gt; 5329&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Object class:&lt;/strong&gt; Eucild&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containment measures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5329 is to be held in a chamber with a heavily locked door. Anybody who comes in contact of SCP-035 will NOT be let in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5329 is a small wooden button. When pressed, the presser will die in the next 5 seconds. Yup, that&#039;s it. Pretty boring SCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
[REDACTED]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It also seems to fnjasgyus&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;
&lt;code&gt;GLITCH OCCURED. SHUTING DOWN.

