&lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;his keyboard autocorrects &#039;coming&#039; into &#039;cumming.&#039; That&#039;s all you need to know.&amp;quot;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-283120-8&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
